    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26000,
    "dDurationMs": 4960,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or\n\u003e\u003e Yeah, I mean, we beat them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28720,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e You went into an area where there was\nsome of the biggest chains in the",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 32000,
    "dDurationMs": 5600,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "country all around you.\n\u003e\u003e The secret to all of this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35400,
    "dDurationMs": 6520,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e If me and you died tomorrow and you had\none more message to leave with the",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 38720,
    "dDurationMs": 6400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "younger generation, what would that be?\n\u003e\u003e Just"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43640,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e What's going on everyone? Welcome back\nto the School of Hard Knocks Podcast.",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46920,
    "dDurationMs": 6320,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm James. I'm here with Jack and Josh\nand we have an incredible guest for you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51120,
    "dDurationMs": 6760,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all today from our hometown in our\nhometown of Austin, Texas. We are with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 55320,
    "dDurationMs": 5800,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Patrick Terry, the hamburger mogul, the\nfounder of P. Terry's. And for those of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59960,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you watching right now, if you're not\nfrom Texas, you got to come out to Texas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63080,
    "dDurationMs": 5160,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to try these hamburgers. We were having\nthe discussion in the car and I'm going"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66280,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to put it out there, full transparency,\nI got P. Terry's over In-N-Out, I got P."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70320,
    "dDurationMs": 5005,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Terry's over Whataburger, and I know\nthese are some of the competitors and"
