    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "brand to a lot of households and\nwhatnot. So, congratulations on your"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95400,
    "dDurationMs": 5240,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\u003e\u003e I appreciate that. I appreciate that. I\nhave one correction,",
      "isSpeakerChange": 1
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98320,
    "dDurationMs": 6680,
    "wWinId": 1,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I am the co-founder, my wife Kathy was\nvery involved and we'll talk about that"
